{"unit_id":"YannZhou__dsh-about#card-zh","repo":"YannZhou/dsh-about","commit":"39497f4151e5b8bf717cdaecb430cd278c7f66f6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-about（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 设置中心增加关于分区，集中展示 DSH、Web 前端和插件版本及运行平台。该分区通过 settings.section 接入 Web 设置界面，调用宿主本地路由读取数据。主要功能包括检查 npm latest/next 更新、选择 npm 官方源或镜像并检测延迟、浏览 GitHub 版本记录，以及安装 DSH 或插件更新并等待自动重启。适合希望在 DSH 内查看版本、了解发布记录并从设置页管理更新的用户。读取 GitHub 发布信息可选使用 GITHUB_TOKEN；更新检查连接 npm 注册表。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1995-2019","lib/index.js:2541-2550"]}
{"unit_id":"YannZhou__dsh-about#card-en","repo":"YannZhou/dsh-about","commit":"39497f4151e5b8bf717cdaecb430cd278c7f66f6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-about adds an About section to DSH Web settings with version and platform details. It checks npm updates, switches registries, displays GitHub release notes, and updates DSH or itself with automatic restart. GitHub release access can optionally use GITHUB_TOKEN.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1995-2019","lib/index.js:2541-2550"]}
